# Ensure binary/generated file types are never subjected to CRLF/LF
# line-ending normalization (core.autocrlf) — that conversion corrupts
# binary formats like PDF, XLSX, DOCX.
*.pdf   -text binary
*.xlsx  -text binary
*.docx  -text binary
*.png   -text binary
*.jpg   -text binary
*.jpeg  -text binary
*.gif   -text binary
*.zip   -text binary
*.db    -text binary
*.ico   -text binary
